    {
      "id": "inversion",
      "name": "Inverze",
      "cards": [
        {"en": "Never have I seen such beauty", "cz": "Nikdy jsem neviděl takovou krásu"},
        {"en": "Rarely do we get such opportunities", "cz": "Zřídka dostáváme takové příležitosti"},
        {"en": "Not only did he apologize, but he also paid", "cz": "Nejenže se omluvil, ale také zaplatil"},
        {"en": "Hardly had I arrived when it started raining", "cz": "Sotva jsem dorazil, začalo pršet"},
        {"en": "No sooner had she left than he called", "cz": "Sotva odešla, zavolal"},
        {"en": "Little did I know what was coming", "cz": "Netušil jsem, co přijde"},
        {"en": "Under no circumstances should you open this", "cz": "Za žádných okolností to neotvírej"},
        {"en": "Only then did I realize the truth", "cz": "Teprve tehdy jsem pochopil pravdu"},
        {"en": "Seldom have I felt so happy", "cz": "Zřídkakdy jsem se cítil tak šťastný"},
        {"en": "Not until I got home did I notice", "cz": "Teprve doma jsem si všiml"},
        {"en": "So tired was I that I fell asleep", "cz": "Byl jsem tak unavený, že jsem usnul"},
        {"en": "Had I known, I would have acted differently", "cz": "Kdybych to věděl, jednal bych jinak"},
        {"en": "Were it not for you, I would have failed", "cz": "Nebýt tebe, selhal bych"},
        {"en": "Should you need help, just ask", "cz": "Kdybyste potřebovali pomoc, jen řekněte"},
        {"en": "At no time did he mention it", "cz": "V žádném okamžiku se o tom nezmínil"},
        {"en": "In no way am I responsible", "cz": "V žádném případě za to nezodpovídám"},
        {"en": "Not a word did she say", "cz": "Neřekla ani slovo"},
        {"en": "Only after he left did she cry", "cz": "Teprve až odešel, se rozplakala"},
        {"en": "Such was his anger that he left", "cz": "Takový byl jeho hněv, že odešel"},
        {"en": "Not once did they complain", "cz": "Ani jednou si nestěžovali"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cleft_sentences",
      "name": "Rozštěpené věty",
      "cards": [
        {"en": "It was John who called you", "cz": "Byl to John, kdo ti volal"},
        {"en": "It was yesterday that I saw her", "cz": "Bylo to včera, kdy jsem ji viděl"},
        {"en": "What I need is a break", "cz": "Co potřebuji, je přestávka"},
        {"en": "What happened was unexpected", "cz": "To, co se stalo, bylo nečekané"},
        {"en": "It's the price that worries me", "cz": "Je to cena, co mě znepokojuje"},
        {"en": "What she said made me think", "cz": "To, co řekla, mě donutilo přemýšlet"},
        {"en": "It was in Paris where we met", "cz": "Bylo to v Paříži, kde jsme se potkali"},
        {"en": "What I want to know is why", "cz": "Co chci vědět, je proč"},
        {"en": "It's not money that matters", "cz": "Nejsou to peníze, na čem záleží"},
        {"en": "The thing that annoys me is his attitude", "cz": "To, co mě štve, je jeho postoj"},
        {"en": "It was because of you that I succeeded", "cz": "Bylo to díky tobě, že jsem uspěl"},
        {"en": "What surprised me was her reaction", "cz": "Co mě překvapilo, byla její reakce"},
        {"en": "It's time that we need", "cz": "Je to čas, co potřebujeme"},
        {"en": "All I want is peace", "cz": "Vše, co chci, je klid"},
        {"en": "It wasn't me who broke it", "cz": "Nebyl jsem to já, kdo to rozbil"},
        {"en": "The reason I called is to ask", "cz": "Důvod, proč volám, je zeptat se"},
        {"en": "What we should do is wait", "cz": "Co bychom měli udělat, je počkat"},
        {"en": "It's how you say it that matters", "cz": "Záleží na tom, jak to řekneš"},
        {"en": "What bothers me is the noise", "cz": "Co mě obtěžuje, je hluk"},
        {"en": "It was then that I understood", "cz": "Bylo to tehdy, kdy jsem pochopil"}
      ]
    },
